      "content": "The compound index is ordered by `[instrumentKey, tradingDate]`, so this upper-only range also includes every lexicographically earlier instrument. If the requested instrument has no earlier effective mark, the reverse cursor traverses all those unrelated observations before returning undefined. This makes even a first acknowledgment potentially scan most of the store. Bound the range to the requested instrument, e.g. `IDBKeyRange.bound([key.instrumentKey], [key.instrumentKey, key.tradingDate], false, true)`, and add coverage for a missing earlier mark with unrelated instrument history.",
